5. She has singing lessons that require her to be well-rested, as her head must be clear for vocal work. (Verbatim: "I have singing lessons later today so I need to make sure I'm rested and and all good for that because I can't have my head hurt for singing lessons")
6. She is aware of the cringe factor when listening to her own recorded voice, which she attributes to how sound resonates in the skull. (Verbatim: "it's something to do with the sound that you hear will be different because it like resonates around your skull or something I don't know but but yeah")
